Q1) What are Wrapper Classes in Java?

Wrapper Classes are classes that convert primitive data types into objects.

*******

int → Integer
char → Character
double → Double

**********2. Primitive Types and Wrapper Classes

Primitive Type	                                    Wrapper Class
byte	                                               Byte
short	                                               Short
int	                                                   Integer
long	                                               Long
float	                                               Float
double	                                               Double
char	                                               Character
boolean	                                               Boolean